 forget to read the Monolith safety protocols I put in your file.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_100","b","022","love",null,null,null,null,"diantou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["bgm",""],["say","1","I will. You stay safe out there too.",0,""],["w",0.35],["se","se_091"],["stage",1,1,1],["cbg",0,40.0,null,null,"OutCubic",0.8,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_100","a","022",null,0.58,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.8],["show","avg1_144","d","002",0.27,-0.1,1.15,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_144","d",null,null,0.35,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.8],["w",1.0],["se","se_061"],["ctl","avg3_100","a",null,null,null,-0.23,null,0.0,null,"InBack",0.7],["hide","avg3_100",0.7],["w",0.72],["mrt",2,"z","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Phew. Let's hope it's fixed by morning.==W== Our odds are much better if both teams make wishes together.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","014","music","diantou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_101"],["ctl","avg1_144","d",null,null,0.28,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.6],["hide","avg1_144",0.6],["stg",0,-180.0,null,1.1,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.6],["bgm","m46"],["say","avg3_999","I'm afraid that the cable car won't be an easy fix.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",2,"y","021","symbol",null],["say","avg3_100","Huh?!",1,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.1],["show","avg3_100","c","021",null,-0.1,1.15,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_100","c",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.6],["w",0.2],["se","se_101"],["show","avg1_136","b","002",0.4,-0.1,1.15,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_136","b",null,null,0.3,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_999","Industrial steel like that is incredibly hard to wish for. Even if someone manages to spawn it at the Wild Monolith, lugging something that heavy all the way out here is a nightmare.",0,""],["w",0.35],["stg",0,220.0,null,1.15,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_100","c",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.1],["ctl","avg1_136","b","003","music",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_999","You're looking at two or three days, minimum. Probably longer.",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_136","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["hide","avg1_136",0.7],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.05,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.2],["ctl","avg3_100","c","010","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.34],["w",0.34],["say","1","Then we might not even have a way back—",0,""],["w",0.35],["se","se_061"],["ctl","avg3_100","c",null,null,null,-0.2,null,0.0,null,"InBack",0.7],["hide","avg3_100",0.7],["w",0.71],["stg",0,null,null,1.12,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["show","avg1_136","b","005",null,-0.02,1.03,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_136","b",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["mrt",2,"z","007","symbol",null],["tsk","Xiao"],["say","avg3_100","Wait. Se-Serena?! How long have you been standing there?!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_136","b","004","love",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_974","I answered a loyal customer's call. Delivering intel the moment you need it—that's what makes me a professional.",0,""],["se","se_434"],["w",0.45],["stg",0,-250.0,null,1.15,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_136","b","010",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["show","avg1_144","d","002",0.61,-0.03,1.02,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_144","d",null,null,0.7,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.7],["say","avg3_974","That said... I mean you no harm.==W== Would you mind asking your friend to move her blade away from my neck?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","b","007","question",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["goon"],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_144","d","012","idea",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_144","My ==SEX11==. A cloak materialized in the grass behind you, and this strange woman emerged from it.",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_144","d","003","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_144","She speaks the truth. I sensed no malice, which is why I did not immediately cleave her in two. Still, she dared to take the position behind you.",0,""],["w",0.45],["ctl","avg1_144","d",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.2],["ctl","avg1_144","d","012","shock",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_144","How shall we handle her? I await your orders.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_144","d",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["mrt",2,"z","002","exclamation",null],["say","avg3_100","Stand down, Chitose.==W== I know her. This is Serena.",1,""],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_144","d","003",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.3],["se","se_023"],["w",0.21],["ctl","avg1_144","d",null,null,0.76,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.1,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.6],["mrt",1,"y","020","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","She tipped us off about the hotel escape route. She's helped us a lot since we got to Philae.==W== I guess you could call her ... a friend.",1,""],["w",0.8],["mrt",0,"z","003",null,"diantou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","b","008","flurry",null,null,null,null,"chijing","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_974","Aw, I'm honored! The Boss actually considers me a friend.",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_136","b","003","music",null,-0.14,1.2,null,"diantou","OutSine",0.38],["w",0.38],["say","avg3_974","But friendships are a luxury in my line of work. Please, continue to see me as a reliable business partner instead.",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_136","b","004","attention",null,null,null,null,"daintou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_974","Anyway, down to business. Omnisky Aegis has two teams in play.",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_136","b","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_974","One of them hauled a massive sack into the Monolith. No idea what kind of secret weapon is in there, but it reeks of bad news.",0,""],["w",0.4],["mrt",1,"y","021","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","We haven't even paid for your last tip, and you're selling us more?",1,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","b","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_974","Consider it on the house. Let's say I have a distaste for Omnisky Aegis. Plus, that cable car they wrecked was a precious historical site.==W== It is tied to the Armless Saint, after all.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","b","005","idea",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["goon"],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_136","b","004","music",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_974","Think of it as my little way of supporting the Boss. Sound fair?",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_136","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.6],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.7],["w",0.7],["se","se_224"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_movie",0,0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","story_main_03_005_b",0,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.7],["w",1.3],["se","se_221"],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.65],["w",0.65],["bg","story_main_03_006",0,0.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.65],["w",1.3],["se","se_221"],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.65],["w",0.65],["bg","story_main_03_006_d",0,0.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.65],["w",1.3],["se","se_221"],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.65],["w",0.65],["bg","story_main_03_006_a",0,0.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.65],["w",1.3],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.8],["w",0.8],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","tower_entrance",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_movie",1,0],["ctl","avg1_136","b","003",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.3],["trn",1,1