years later, commemorating the Saint's journey. Look under those cable cars and you'll still find the old plaques.",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_136","b","009","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_974","So anyone trying to claim the Saint never existed... Well, they must have their own motives.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Nazuka will love hearing this.==W== When she gets back, we should go hunting for proof together.==W== Could be fun.",2,""],["w",0.6],["mrt",0,"y","024",null,null],["goon"],["w",0.6],["mrt",0,"y","013","music","jushou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.51],["ctl","avg1_136","b","002","attention",null,null,null,null,"daintou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_974","Come to think of it, I'm looking at Philae's newest hero and an attendant with an injured hand right now. You walked that exact same path to the Monolith to end this pointless bidding war.",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_136","b","005","love",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_974","It's almost like that legendary scene. Quite a sight... Too bad someone's trying to ruin the moment.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",2,"z","007","flurry",null],["say","avg3_100","Okay, now you're reaching.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_136","b","004","question",null,-0.14,1.2,null,null,"OutCubic",0.6],["w",0.6],["say","avg3_974","Am I? You know what they say about history repeating itself.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_136","b","005","attention",null,null,null,null,"daintou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["bgm",""],["say","avg3_974","As for my payment for that tip... Come by my room once this is all over, Boss. There's something I need to tell you in person.",0,""],["w",0.35],["clear",0,0,1],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"InSine",1.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_076"],["trn",0,2,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,100.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","sky_tower",0,0.0]